# SEO Tools Platform - Cursor Rules

## Project Context

- Next.js 14 with App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS (utility classes only, no custom CSS files)
- Supabase for backend

## Conventions

- Use the tool template at `tools/_template` when creating new tools
- Register new tools in `lib/toolRegistry.ts`
- Do not modify the sidebar or core layout beyond initial creation
- No auth middleware in base setup
